# pipenv
#   According to pypa/pipenv#598, it is recommended to check in Pipfile.lock into version control.
#   However, in cases of ecosystem fragmentation, it may be better to ignore this file.
#   Pipfile.lock

# poetry
#   Similar to Pipfile.lock, it is generally recommended to check poetry.lock into version control.
#   This is a personal preference depending on whether you want strict reproducible builds.
#   poetry.lock

# pdm
#   Similar to Pipfile.lock, it's generally recommended to check pdm.lock into version control.
